<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial downgraded Compaq Computer Corp to short-term hold from buy, market sources said.  </p>
<p>-- Firm later confirmed action.</p>
<p>-- Long-term rating kept at buy.</p>
<p>-- Fiscal 1997 earnings estimate cut to $6.16 per share from $6.29.</p>
<p>-- Fiscal 1998 earnings estimate kept at $7.43 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-3/8 to 73-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
